        bio: "Tadeusz “Ted” Kowalski, 36, runs Kowalski's Market. Was at Bastogne with the 101st Airborne that winter; came home with a Silver Star he keeps in a drawer and has never mentioned to a living soul. Talks about kielbasa, the Red Sox and the weather. Not the war. Never the war. Bowls a 210 on Thursdays at Harbor Lanes and never smiles doing it.",
