        bio: "Filomena “Mena” Silva, 21, the fastest needle on Market Street. Saves every Saturday's pay for an electric sewing machine of her own from Tremblay Furniture, a dollar a week on layaway. Going to the street dance with Rita Wojcik and Josie DeLuca: three girls from the waterfront, and the boys of Juniper Bay have been warned.",
