    bio: "Eleni Papadakis, 52, has worked the counter of the Harbor Light since 1938 and remembers the order of every regular in town — and most of their troubles. Tuesday afternoons she plays mahjong with Lily Lee, Esther Adler and Rosa Castellano, and wins. Her Dutch apple pie is entered in the contest her own husband is judging, which she considers his problem.",
